{"ID":"20240504154023-5ku0yr6","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240504154023-5ku0yr6","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240504154023-5ku0yr6\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240617152801-yesnf5z\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240614153426-tn2elh0\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:1000,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240617152801-yesnf5z\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:0,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:0\u0026#125;","title":"011曾青","updated":"20240504154023"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240617152801-yesnf5z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617152801-yesnf5z","updated":"20240617152801"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240617152801-vz9v098.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240617152630-23y91w6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240617152630-23y91w6","updated":"20240617152630"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240617152630-5phm116.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240614154300-r7fazx7","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614154300-r7fazx7"}},{"ID":"20240614154401-ab7fbhn","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614154401-ab7fbhn","updated":"20240614154405"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"曾青《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240614154401-vytut8d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154401-vytut8d","updated":"20240614154401"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味酸小寒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154401-j12kwlc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154401-j12kwlc","updated":"20240614154401"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主目痛止泪，出风痹，利关节，通九窍，破症坚积聚。久服轻身不老。能化金铜，生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154401-k78ew7q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154401-k78ew7q","updated":"20240614154401"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生蜀中及越巂，采无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154401-wkqkwvs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154401-wkqkwvs","updated":"20240614154401"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案管子揆度篇云：秦明山之曾青；《荀子》云：南海则有曾青，杨倞注，曾青，铜之精；《范子计然》云：曾青山宏农豫章，白青出新涂，青色者善；《淮南子》地形训云：青天八百岁生青曾；高诱云：青曾，青石也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154300-k48tz70","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614154300-k48tz70"}},{"ID":"20240614154310-7q8vtk7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614154310-7q8vtk7","updated":"20240614154314"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"曾青《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614154310-fnflm1l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154310-fnflm1l","updated":"20240614154310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味酸，小寒，无毒。主目痛，止泪出、风痹，利关节，通九窍，破症坚、积聚，养肝胆，除寒热，杀白虫，疗头风、脑中寒，止烦渴，补不足，盛阴气。久服轻身不老。能化金铜。生蜀中山谷及越 ，采无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154310-awx4l9b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154310-awx4l9b","updated":"20240614154310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"畏菟丝子。此说与空青同山，疗体亦相似。今铜官更无曾青，惟出始兴。形累累如黄连相缀，色理小类空青，甚难得而贵，《仙经》少用之。化金之法，事同空青。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154310-jwpe48e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154310-jwpe48e","updated":"20240614154310"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕曾青出蔚次鄂州，余州并不任用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154342-ysophht","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614154342-ysophht"}},{"ID":"20240614154343-ka4l06r","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614154343-ka4l06r","updated":"20240614154349"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"曾青《增广和剂局方药性总论》"}]},{"ID":"20240614154343-u87yvbm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154343-u87yvbm","updated":"20240614154343"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味酸，小寒，无毒。主目痛，止泪出，风痹，利关节，通九窍，破症坚积聚，养肝胆，除寒热，杀白虫，疗头风脑中寒，止烦渴，补不足，盛阴气。久服轻身不老，能化金、铜。《青霞子》云∶爽神气。畏∶菟丝子。《唐本》云∶出蔚州者好，鄂州次之。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154318-0dixdgr","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614154318-0dixdgr"}},{"ID":"20240614154320-04vw739","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614154320-04vw739","updated":"20240614154324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"曾青《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240614154320-r9g0uje","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154320-r9g0uje","updated":"20240614154320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"曾音层，其青层层而生故名。形如蚯蚓屎者真。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154320-exj0n39","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154320-exj0n39","updated":"20240614154320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"酸小寒，无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154320-33xnapq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154320-33xnapq","updated":"20240614154320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主目痛，止泪出风痹，利关节，通九窍，破症坚积聚，久服轻身不老。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154320-thtfzxv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154320-thtfzxv","updated":"20240614154320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"曾青治目，义同空青，以其并出铜矿，与绿青同一根源，曾青则绿青之祖气也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154320-fzyvrbf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154320-fzyvrbf","updated":"20240614154320"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"古方太乙神精丹用之。扁鹊治积聚留饮有曾青丸，并见《古今录验》方。曾空二青，近世绝罕。《千金》云∶当取昆仑绿代之，即绿青也。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154300-84rnenq","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614154300-84rnenq"}},{"ID":"20240614154301-zk3sgya","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614154301-zk3sgya","updated":"20240614154305"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"曾青《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240614154301-eqhct0b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154301-eqhct0b","updated":"20240614154301"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味酸，小寒，无毒。主目痛，止泪出，风痹，利关节，通九窍，破症坚积聚，养肝胆，除寒热，杀白虫。疗头风脑中寒，止烦渴。补不足，盛阴气。久服轻身不老。能化金铜。生蜀中山谷及越 ，采无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153414-5ouenga","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614153414-5ouenga"}},{"ID":"20240614154239-g0sh76p","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614154239-g0sh76p","updated":"20240614154255"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"曾青《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240614154239-iyk17ue","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154239-iyk17ue","updated":"20240614154239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味酸小寒。主目痛。止泪出。风痹利关节。通九窍。破症坚积聚。久服轻身不老。能化金铜。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154239-6up2e4b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154239-6up2e4b","updated":"20240614154239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"逾八百载。是生青曾。光回调吸。积破瘕症。珠连累累。金化层层。启关解节。妙合而凝。"}]},{"ID":"20240614154239-t72o4tm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614154239-t72o4tm","updated":"20240614154239"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"淮南子。青天八百岁生青曾。黄庭经注。常存日月于两目。使光与身合则通真矣。陶弘景曰。形累累如黄连相缀。费冠卿记。层层倚空。周子说。妙合而凝。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153429-y5exyq7","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614153429-y5exyq7"}},{"ID":"20240614153641-g6l0m8o","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614153641-g6l0m8o","updated":"20240614153646"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"曾青《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240614153641-z2ioctb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153641-z2ioctb","updated":"20240614153641"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"无毒．主养肝胆，除寒热，杀白虫，治头风、脑中寒，止烦渴，补不足，盛阴气．生中及越 ，采无时．（畏菟丝子．）"}]},{"ID":"20240614153641-zom66o6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153641-zom66o6","updated":"20240614153710"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文∶曾青，味酸，小寒．主目痛，止泪出，风痹，利关节，通九窍，破症坚积聚．久服轻身不老.能化金铜，生山谷."}]},{"ID":"20240614153430-zbbasay","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614153430-zbbasay"}},{"ID":"20240614153504-2upsfum","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614153504-2upsfum","updated":"20240614153507"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"曾青《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240614153504-x0v0f4n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153504-x0v0f4n","updated":"20240614153504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"曾青无毒小酸寒，头风目泪痹痛安，止渴破 神气爽，利窍通关益胆肝。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153504-ip6vmvm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153504-ip6vmvm","updated":"20240614153504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"曾，层也，层层石中包含而色青也。其形小，累累连珠相缀，与空青同山，不空者为曾青，甚难得。主头风脑中寒，目痛泪出，风痹。止烦渴，破 积，补阴，爽神气，利关节，通九窍，养肝胆。畏菟丝子。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153430-8per6fh","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614153430-8per6fh"}},{"ID":"20240614153456-758fiu7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614153456-758fiu7","updated":"20240614153459"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"曾青《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240614153456-suij7s7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153456-suij7s7","updated":"20240614153456"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」曾，音层。曾青，即层青。就是成为层状的空青。李时珍说：“曾青治目，义同空青”。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153456-52znvky","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153456-52znvky","updated":"20240614153456"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」酸、小寒、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153456-oo0837c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153456-oo0837c","updated":"20240614153456"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240614153456-0vtr8y3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153456-0vtr8y3","updated":"20240614153456"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、风热目疾（眼红或烂，怕太阳光，眼屎多，常流泪，或痒或痛）。用曾青四两，蔓荆子二两，炮姜、防风各一两，共研细，经常以少许吸入鼻中，有效。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153456-gewzt5p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153456-gewzt5p","updated":"20240614153456"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、耳内恶疮。用曾青五钱、雄黄七钱半、黄芩二钱五分，共研为末，搽疮上。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153414-zj6e6e2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614153414-zj6e6e2"}},{"ID":"20240614153444-b3a1sx8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614153444-b3a1sx8","updated":"20240614153451"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"曾青《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240614153444-mw25qcr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153444-mw25qcr","updated":"20240614153444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味酸，小寒，无毒。主目痛，止泪出，风痹，利关节，通九窍，破症坚积聚，养肝胆，除寒热，杀白虫，疗头风、脑中寒，止烦渴，补不足，盛阴气，久服轻身不老。能化金、铜。生蜀中山谷及越 。采无时。（畏菟丝子。）"}]},{"ID":"20240614153444-hf6rp6r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153444-hf6rp6r","updated":"20240614153444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶此说与空青同山，疗体亦相似。今铜官更无曾青，唯出始兴。形累累如黄连相缀，色理小类空青，甚难得而贵。《仙经》少用之。化金之法，事同空青。唐本注云∶曾青出蔚州、鄂州，蔚州者好，其次鄂州，余州并不任用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153444-4pttq0i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153444-4pttq0i","updated":"20240614153444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经文具空青条下。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153444-s1zg75c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153444-s1zg75c","updated":"20240614153444"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雷公云∶凡使，勿用夹石及铜青，若修事一两，要紫背天葵、甘草、青芝草三件，干、湿各一镒，并细锉，放于一瓷埚内，将曾青于中。以东流水二镒并诸药等，缓缓煮之，五昼夜，勿令水火失时，足取出，以东流水浴过，却入乳钵中，研如粉用。丹房镜源∶曾青结汞制丹砂，金气之所生。宝藏论∶曾青若住火成膏者，可立制汞成银，转得八石。清霞子∶爽神气。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153415-2dmt0s0","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614153415-2dmt0s0"}},{"ID":"20240614153424-ic9vl33","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-ic9vl33","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：曾青"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-853qktp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-853qktp","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-zw6jre9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-zw6jre9","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Cénɡ Qīnɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-gjt4lwf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-gjt4lwf","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-egjpsq5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-egjpsq5","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 朴青（《石药尔雅》），层青（《造化指南》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-51cupdt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-51cupdt","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-gysui2a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-gysui2a","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-z3l0p7f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-z3l0p7f","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-cy1bzto","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-cy1bzto","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为碳酸盐类矿物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"蓝铜矿"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"矿石成层状者"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-nz1wkwa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-nz1wkwa","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-4je4kj6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-4je4kj6","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 矿物形态详\"扁青\"条。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-1tcczwp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-1tcczwp","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-85qow5e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-85qow5e","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《雷公炮炙论》：\"凡使曾青，勿用夹石及铜青，若修事一两，要紫背天葵、甘草、青芝草三件，干湿各一镒，并细锉，放于一瓷埚内，将曾青于中，以水二镒缓缓煮之五昼夜，勿令水火失，时足取出，以水浴过，却入乳钵中研如粉用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-sxrezrn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-sxrezrn","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-4e8f24z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-4e8f24z","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《玉楸药解》：\"入足厥阴肝经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-0e0pxgn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-0e0pxgn","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-c2ye6jt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-c2ye6jt","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①《本经》：\"味酸，小寒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-19vlbso","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-19vlbso","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-1stzfgj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-1stzfgj","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-uwuon40","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-uwuon40","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草经集注》：\"畏菟丝子。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-b5e6vft","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-b5e6vft","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-5e05wf5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-5e05wf5","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 明目，镇惊，杀虫。治风热目赤，疼痛，涩痒，眵多赤烂，头风，惊痫，风痹。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-44um5sx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-44um5sx","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主目痛，止泪出，风痹。利关节，通九窍，破症坚积聚。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-n2thd51","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-n2thd51","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"养肝胆，除寒热，杀白虫，疗头风，脑中寒，止烦渴，补不足，盛阴气。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-kl3vbj8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-kl3vbj8","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《玉楸药解》：\"明目去翳。\""}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-aw4569l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-aw4569l","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-fszz7so","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-fszz7so","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 外用：为末点眼或调敷。内服：入丸、散。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-sr719jy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-sr719jy","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-991stt5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-991stt5","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治目生眵蔑：曾青、水精各一两，龙脑、真珠各等分，琥珀半两。上五味研如粉，以铜器收盛，临卧用铜箸点如黍米许。（《圣济总录》曾青散）"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-wthp7eq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-wthp7eq","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治两眼多生眵泪，怕日羞明，眶烂赤肿痒痛，及时行暴赤眼，睛昏涩痛：曾青四两，蔓荆子（去皮）二两，防风（去芦）、白姜（炮）各一两。上为细末，每用少许末，搐入鼻中。（《局方》曾青散）"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-c02vu2v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-c02vu2v","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③治耳内有恶疮：曾青五钱，雄黄七钱半，黄芩二钱半。上为末，每用少许纳耳中，如有脓汁，以棉杖子拭干用之。（《卫生宝鉴》曾青散）"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-agd2bld","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-agd2bld","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④治癫痫，惊风，压热镇心：曾青四两，黄丹一两，白锡二两。上研曾青、黄丹，安于坩埚内，白锡为屑，盖之，后入炉，以炭五斤烧之，候锡熔即取出，放冷细研，以白粱米饭和丸，如绿豆大，空心，以冷水下五丸。（《圣惠方》曾青丹）"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-c8y77xl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-c8y77xl","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-enaxhsb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-enaxhsb","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-tqzckno","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-tqzckno","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》《中药大辞典》：曾青"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-frgcxhw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-frgcxhw","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-x1kuib9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-x1kuib9","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Cénɡ Qīnɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-80xxfuu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-80xxfuu","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-5hr7klm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-5hr7klm","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 朴青、赤龙翘、青龙血、黄云英、层青"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-jfggs03","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-jfggs03","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-sdmxgay","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-sdmxgay","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Azurite"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-hq2hrb1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-hq2hrb1","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-ymau1tr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-ymau1tr","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 出自《神农本草经》；1.《名医别录》：曾青，采无时。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-czbe0va","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-czbe0va","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.陶弘景：(曾青)说与空青同山，疗体亦相似，今铜官更无曾青，惟出始兴，形累累如黄连相缀，色理小类空青，甚难得而贵。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-btq6hpm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-btq6hpm","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《唐本草》：曾青， 出蔚州、鄂州。蔚外者好，其次鄂州，余州并不任用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-bjj1dv3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-bjj1dv3","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《纲目》：曾青，但出铜处年古即生，形如黄连相缀，又如蚯蚓屎，方棱，色深如波斯青黛，层层而生，打之如金声者为真。《衡山记》云，山有层青"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-2obc3um","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-2obc3um","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-bjbparp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-bjbparp","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为碳酸盐类矿物蓝铜矿的矿石成层状者。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-eepvxez","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-eepvxez","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Azurite"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-dvmtmt6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-dvmtmt6","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-unr6uui","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-unr6uui","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：分面于含铜矿床氧化带，于铁帽下的淋滤带与空青、扁青及各种矾共存。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-dtfwpwz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-dtfwpwz","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：产于内蒙古、吉林、辽宁、青海、西藏、四川、湖北、湖南、广东等地。其他产有孔雀石、蓝铜矿的矿区亦可有此资源。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-4d9w978","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-4d9w978","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-9scb439","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-9scb439","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 单斜晶系。晶体短柱状或板状。通常呈粒状、肾状、散射状、土状等块体或被覆在其他铜矿之表面，呈深蓝色。条痕为浅篮色。光泽呈玻璃状、金刚石状或土状。半透明至不透明。断口呈贝壳状，硬度3.5-4。比重3.7-3.9。性脆。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-y5bpe5i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-y5bpe5i","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-tf10fwg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-tf10fwg","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 性状鉴别 本品为扁平块状。深蓝色，表面间有绿色薄层（绿青）。不透明，土状光泽。质较硬，不易砸碎，断面不平坦。气无，味无。以层理明显、色蓝、质硬、打之有金属声者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-egqjdc0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-egqjdc0","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-7lrmzvm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-7lrmzvm","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 主要为碱式碳酸铜[Cu3(CO3)2(OH)2]。尚含铅、锌、铜、镍、钴、钼、钛、锰、钇、镱、钙、铍、铁、铝、镁、硅、锶、钡等元素。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-lc0vc4l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-lc0vc4l","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-qr25z66","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-qr25z66","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《雷公炮炙论》：凡使曾青，勿用夹石及铜青，若修事一两，要紫背天葵、甘草、青芝草三件，干湿各一镒，并细锉，放于一瓷埚内，将曾青于中，以水二镒缓缓煮之五昼夜，勿令水火失，时足取出，以水浴过，却入乳钵中研如粉用。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-dtejagq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-dtejagq","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-g2j0fh0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-g2j0fh0","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" (1)本品用强火焰烧之，火焰呈绿色；；加盐酸浸湿后烧之，火焰呈蓝绿色。（检查铜盐）(2)本品具碳酸盐和铜盐的各种反应。参见“绿青”条。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-tn06p3l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-tn06p3l","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"(3)差热分析曲线 吸热305℃（大），505℃（小）；220-450℃（失重），465-530℃（增重），530-585℃（失重）。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-gubbuz2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-gubbuz2","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-dpgzxbo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-dpgzxbo","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肝经"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-natypn1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-natypn1","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-d6wukd6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-d6wukd6","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 酸；寒；小毒"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-2ahjupz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-2ahjupz","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-ow8v58j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-ow8v58j","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本草经集注》：畏菟丝子。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-vtnnyfw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-vtnnyfw","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-nsva7r5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-nsva7r5","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 凉肝明目；祛风定惊。主目赤疼痛；涩痒；眵多赤烂；头风；惊痫；风痹"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-136no6b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-136no6b","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-xs69f7a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-xs69f7a","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 外用：为末点眼或调敷。内服：入丸、散。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-sojt8dg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-sojt8dg","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-78bhkd9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-78bhkd9","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治目生眵MIE:曾青、水精各一两，龙脑、真珠各等分，琥珀半两。上五味研如粉，以铜器收盛，临卧用铜箸点如黍米许。 (《圣济总录》曾青散)②治两眼多生眵泪，怕日羞明，眶烂赤肿痒痛，及时行暴赤眼，睛昏涩痛: 曾青四两，蔓荆子(去皮)二两，防风(去声)、白姜(炮)各一两。上为细末，每用少许末，搐人鼻中。(《局方》曾青散)③治耳内有恶疮: 曾青五钱，雄黄七钱半，黄芩二钱半。上为末，每用少许纳耳中，如有脓汁， 以棉杖子拭干用之。(《卫生宝鉴》曾青散)④治癫痫，惊风，压热镇心: 曾青四两，黄丹一两，白锡二两。上研曾青、黄丹，安于坩埚内，白锡为屑，盖之，后入炉，以炭五斤烧之，候锡熔即取出，放冷细研，以自粱米饭和丸，如绿豆大，空心，以冷水下五丸。 (《圣惠方》曾青丹)"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-1szk0kp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-1szk0kp","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-m678wdc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-m678wdc","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本经》：主目痛，止泪出，风痹。利关节，通九窍，破症坚积聚。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-231mfgp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-231mfgp","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《别录》：养肝胆，除寒热，杀白虫，疗头风，脑中寒，止烦渴，补不足，盛阴气。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-mlsq3jq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-mlsq3jq","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《玉揪药解》：明目去翳。"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-lvra9w3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-lvra9w3","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240614153424-ky91ier","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153424-ky91ier","updated":"20240614153424"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240614153425-8zlo2la","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240614153425-8zlo2la"}},{"ID":"20240614153426-tn2elh0","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240614153426-tn2elh0"}}]}